  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Finalisation of Pro Doc for Twinning Cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the pre-project is to allow the National Association of Municipalities in Denmark together with Ukrainian and Danish municipalities to identify possible areas for cooperation and hereby contribute to the reconstruction and future development of Mykolaiv City/Region as well as other Ukrainian cities.  The pre-project has served to design a longer term twinning cooperation facility and to explore possible areas of cooperation in targeted Ukrainian municipalities in more details.</narrative>
  </description>
